        {
          "text": "Aka munyo Yohana oyido cegin cowo tic pere, openjo ji ni, “Wiparo ni an a ŋa? Akibedo ŋata wikuro. To neni win, go luwan cen, aka akiripi kada lunyo war ma tiende.”",
