              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutmera, nyikway Abraham, kodi Jopath je manitie ka ma jolamo Were: Fonji ma mako kwoŋ both me otiek dhiro riwan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
